            <ArticleTitle>Reference database of the main physiological parameters in Sprague-Dawley rats from 6 to 32 months.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>457-66</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A reference database comprising body weight gain, exploratory activity, hot plate response, serum biochemistry, haematology, organ weight (%) and a complete anatomopathological study containing non-neoplastic and neoplastic lesions over 1200 Sprague-Dawley rats from 6 to 32 months is described. Comparisons between age and sex were analysed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
